WEBVTT

00:00:00.299 --> 00:00:03.789
Validation Evidence remains available under Advanced Automation.

00:00:04.011 --> 00:00:08.269
It supports ZTF evidence packs and retained historical downloads.

00:00:08.405 --> 00:00:12.963
It is not the former NKP execution workspace and it is not a general live

00:00:12.971 --> 00:00:17.196
health dashboard. This revised lesson replaces the earlier NKP preview

00:00:17.196 --> 00:00:21.838
instructions. For Cluster A, select the supported workflow or saved

00:00:21.846 --> 00:00:24.206
configuration source relevant to your review.

00:00:24.364 --> 00:00:28.052
Inspect the source file, job reference and collection time.

00:00:28.215 --> 00:00:32.346
A package assembled from a saved configuration demonstrates what was supplied;

00:00:32.354 --> 00:00:35.485
it does not prove the infrastructure applied every value.

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:39.800
Open the evidence details and distinguish simulated data, declarations

00:00:40.064 --> 00:00:42.275
and actual recorded readbacks.

00:00:42.453 --> 00:00:44.978
Preserve the original result and its source.

00:00:45.214 --> 00:00:49.281
A historical record keeps the meaning and limitations it had when created;

00:00:49.396 --> 00:00:53.996
it is not upgraded into current acceptance by opening it in a newer console.

00:00:54.302 --> 00:00:58.860
New NKP setup, profile execution and NKP-specific evidence

00:00:58.996 --> 00:01:03.655
creation are retired. Earlier videos may show controls that no longer provide

00:01:03.791 --> 00:01:05.425
a supported launch path.

00:01:05.668 --> 00:01:10.319
Retain historical records under the agreed retention policy and use the retirement

00:01:10.319 --> 00:01:12.068
guide for authorized inspection.

00:01:12.477 --> 00:01:16.779
For present PE health, use the explicit cluster collection and its trust

00:01:16.787 --> 00:01:21.259
requirements. For recovery, use the evidence required by that saved

00:01:21.267 --> 00:01:25.704
run. For application restoration, complete the backup platform's acceptance

00:01:25.704 --> 00:01:29.974
process. Keep each evidence type attached to the question it can actually

00:01:30.110 --> 00:01:30.915
answer.
